      "message": "yes exactly, @kopyscinski@google.com here what you can do:\n\n```suggestion\n  \"flags\": {\n    \"always_use_preset_cache\": [\"\u003ctest_name\u003e\"]\n  }\n```\n\nNote that `test_name` is a prefix hence you will run every test that start with the prefix.\n\nI see you would like to use two flags, `always_use_preset_cache ` and `leaudio_allow_leaudio_only_devices`, do you need both of this flags for the tests to be run ?\n\nIf so, then this is currently not yet supported but I am actively implemented the flag logic hence I can add this logic as well.",
